2 CONT King Zhending of Zhou, (simplified Chinese: 周贞定王; traditional Chinese: 周貞定王; pinyin: zhōu zhēn dìng wáng; Wade-Giles: King Chenting of Chou) was the twenty-eighth sovereign of the Chinese Zhou Dynasty and the sixteenth of Eastern 
2 CONC Zhou Dynasty.
2 CONT
