1 CONT           o Prince Liu Can (??), initially of Taiyuan (created 178 BC), later of Dai (created 175 BC) (d. 161 BC), known as Prince Xiao of Dai
1 CONT           o Prince Liu Yi (??) of Liang (d. 169 BC), of a fall from a horse, known as Prince Huai of Liang
